3	//! This service exposes read-only access to the files that make up a
4	//! collection's storage directory. Every request is subject to:
5	//!
6	//! * path validation — traversal (`..`), current-directory (`.`, `./`) and
7	//!   absolute paths are rejected before any filesystem access;
